set {gameOver} = false
set {gameWin} = false
join character_overlay center [animation="Instant In"]
join character_richGirl center
character_richGirl: The magic here is... impressive. You're an alchemist?
character_richGirl: I've never seen you before though. Is this a new shop?
character_richGirl (Positive): Haha, that's great. New things are always welcome.
character_richGirl: Anything I need... hm... my ex is in town this month...
character_richGirl (Negative): Poison?! No, never! Are you mad?!
character_richGirl: ...Maybe not yet, I just don't want him to see me right now.
character_richGirl: Invisibility? That doesn't sound too bad... but I know that will backfire... I still want others to see me of course.
character_richGirl (Positive): A specialized one that makes him unable to see me and only me? You can do that? Wow, you must be a Grand Caster or something!
character_richGirl (Negative): ...You're a drop out? In some ways that makes me uneasy, but this workshop you have IS quite incredible...
character_richGirl: Alright then, my instincts tell me you got what it takes to meet my demands... do your work magician...
